{"about_the_game":"Climb to the sky while collecting countless stars.<br />\r\nNumerous gimmicks will try to knock you down without mercy,<br />\r\nBut if you keep going and don't give up, you will reach the top someday.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u25a0Game Features<br />\r\nThe game is a game of climbing up while collecting stars scattered in the field.<br />\r\nYou can save and stop the game at the starting point and at several other magic circles.<br />\r\nThe higher difficulty mode will be opened after the game is cleared.<br />\r\nAdditional costumes will be added after the game is cleared depending on the stars obtained (16 costumes in total, including the initial ones).<br />\r\nThe availability of gold stars will be reset after clearing the game, but the availability of stars of different colors will continue.<br />\r\n\u3000(If you have already obtained them, they will be placed on the field in a semi-transparent state.)","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"\u7d42\u4e86","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3117630/8041bed2b06e51da953d79cc116ecfdd97c19bc3.jpg"},{"name":"\u751f\u9084","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3117630/d8633cc5d5931a0626f0ad37291dfc9d0b9bab75.jpg"},{"name":"\u8d85\u4eba","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3117630/962b3ed435c96931bed61cbe8b1d349d1af9abc1.jpg"},{"name":"\u5c01\u795e","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3117630/535b17bebb37a9a52a7118d7e10d4e6403b05f36.jpg"},{"name":"\u84bc\u661f","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3117630/e3744a6f5dcf79eb96cf7ec1cd7e87c67e9b20fb.jpg"},{"name":"\u8d6b\u661f","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3117630/12a4df4cd4e6b85fc47c3f06840c5fa6da803840.jpg"}],"total":6},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3117630